#: ../../source/docs/common-pixracer-serial-names.rst:31
#: 1c515f18fd874e0fac564d5972da5ac8 1ff018e9a9c344089c903ea89f51a1ad
#: 3f3e2d6e219441c2bdaa8e193b80fd38 8565f8f7e8bf4a6ca7af2d3e8a576bb8
#: c86773f8872046939108f8a400bb7805 f019764cdbff4c51a93b9b7d4b739565
msgid ""
"** While the default here is GPS, the port is inverted so this won't work "
"with a GPS, it was intended for use with FrSky receivers for telemetry.  "
"Usually :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` should be set to an FrSky "
"protocol and a diode tied from TX (anode) to RX and attached to the SPort of"
" an FrSky receiver.Alternatively, :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` "
"can be set to 2, to disable the inverters for normal use."
msgstr ""
"** 虽然此处默认为 GPS，但端口已反转，因此不适合连接 GPS，它原本用于连接 FrSky 接收机进行数传。通常 "
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 应设置为 FrSky 协议，并将二极管从 TX（阳极）连接到 "
"RX，再连接到 FrSky 接收机的 SPort。或者，:ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 可设置为 2 "
"以禁用反相器供普通使用。"

